        "what_is_reused": "the 2-D complex lattice reservoir with a linear readout, corrected: an exactly unitary Crank-Nicolson step replaces the original 5-point update (which does not conserve sum |psi|^2), plus explicit leak and a Kerr-type phase nonlinearity. Classical, Schrodinger-inspired; nothing quantum is computed."
